  "description": "PIWNIW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H124 La6 Mn1 O40. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 9 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.597-4.365 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.95-118.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La6Mn(μ3-OH)8(acac)12(CH3OH)8]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
